        <detaileddescription>
<para>Class for processing references to fixes, computes and variables</para>
<para>This class provides an abstraction for the repetitive task of parsing arguments that may contain references to fixes, computes, variables, or custom per-atom properties. It will identify the name and the index value in the first and second dimension, if present.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>arg</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>string with possible reference </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>allowed</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>integer with bitmap of allowed types of references </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
